[thin] Numerical threshold boundary: these exact pairs span authored 3.000 mm MQ-6 post or core-stop sections. Their native interiors are material and their endpoint coordinate differences are exactly 3.000 mm. Floating-point ranking immediately below the 3 mm search reach does not establish a smaller design section. Printed dimensions and loaded behavior remain unqualified.
alternatives: Use an explicit numerical tolerance at the requested thickness threshold. Enlarging a nominal 3 mm fitted section merely to change its floating-point rank has no dimensional basis.
